WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.980
He [Reverend Jemison] went down and entered into a compromise with the mayor and the city council that they wouldn’t desegregate the bus.

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:18.180
Jemison thought that was right as long as it was “separate but equal,” because that was the law.

3
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.467
There wasn’t any animosity between us.

4
00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:27.700
It’s just that I didn’t agree; because to me, “separate but equal” was wrong.
